Introduction
------------
		Here's the new version with, I hope, all of the changes
		requested.

		If you have the old version of POKER.OPA then please 
		delete the directory \APP\POKER as this and all of
 		files it contains is no longer needed.

How to play
-----------
               Just make your bet selection from œ1 to œ100,000 
               then your cards for the first round are dealt to you.

               The aim of the game is to make the best hand out of the
               cards you are given.

               This is achieved by discarding any unwanted cards,
               use the CURSOR Left/Right keys to hilite a card then
               press SPACE to flip it around ready for discarding,
               pressing SPACE again flips it back.                                                

               Then press ENTER to discard all of your flipped cards and
               replace them with new ones. You can only do this once so
               choose carefully !   
 
               Use the MENU key for the menus and the HELP key for the help.             


Installation
------------
               1) Copy POKER.OPA into an \APP directory on any disk.
               4) Install the POKER.OPA application.


               N.B. 
                   POKER.OPA doesn't write out any files, so it can
		   be on a FLASH SSD with no problems.

